From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:35:04 +0000
Subject: deps: add missing standard library includes to simdjson

simdjson.h and simdjson.cpp use several standard library names before
(or without) including the header that declares them, e.g. std::copy
(<algorithm>), std::exception (<exception>), std::nothrow (<new>),
std::FILE/std::fopen/std::snprintf (<cstdio>), std::isspace (<cctype>),
std::is_same (<type_traits>), std::numeric_limits (<limits>) and the
iterator helpers (<iterator>). They currently compile only because
other headers include these transitively.

These includes are needed to build with clang modules, where libc++
uses local submodule visibility and a declaration must be imported
from its own module before it is used.

We're still exploring ways to upstream this. This patch can be removed
once Node.js vendors a simdjson release that includes these headers.

diff --git a/deps/simdjson/simdjson.cpp b/deps/simdjson/simdjson.cpp
index 71f443b3d2bb4394009600cde34935ec25eff30b..505dc6406f6e14858124a823170f9fbd2fb7c7d8 100644
--- a/deps/simdjson/simdjson.cpp
+++ b/deps/simdjson/simdjson.cpp
@@ -3,6 +3,12 @@
 /* begin file simdjson.cpp */
 #define SIMDJSON_SRC_SIMDJSON_CPP
 
+#include <cstdio>
+#include <exception>
+#include <limits>
+#include <new>
+#include <type_traits>
+
 /* including base.h: #include <base.h> */
 /* begin file base.h */
 #ifndef SIMDJSON_SRC_BASE_H
diff --git a/deps/simdjson/simdjson.h b/deps/simdjson/simdjson.h
index 91b0fc22e5965ddb3378887867b5c5c951ae7226..919e9532f00092997710882a8b223e7b8c1f1096 100644
--- a/deps/simdjson/simdjson.h
+++ b/deps/simdjson/simdjson.h
@@ -4,6 +4,14 @@
 #ifndef SIMDJSON_H
 #define SIMDJSON_H
 
+#include <algorithm>
+#include <cctype>
+#include <cstdio>
+#include <exception>
+#include <iterator>
+#include <new>
+#include <type_traits>
+
